The Ed25519 public key used to verify engine builds
(src/SpaceWay.Core/Engine/robust_signing_key.pub) belongs to
Space Wizards Federation and is taken from the same project.

The engine, content and loader code (src/SpaceWay.Core/Engine/,
src/SpaceWay.Core/Content/, src/SpaceWay.Loader/) is an independent
implementation. It follows the same file formats and download protocol,
which are defined by the engine.

